~ level_start

Astronaut: Mission control, my tether snapped! I'm drifting away from the ship.
Astronaut: Nothing to do but float forward, dodge the rocks, and get back aboard.
=> END

~ level_end

Astronaut: Airlock sealed. I made it back in one piece!
Astronaut: Next time, somebody else can do the spacewalk.
=> END

~ oxygen_low

Astronaut: Aw shiii... I'm running out of oxygen!
Astronaut: I have to get back to the ship before the tank runs dry!
=> END
